{"title":"Career Roadmap · Media Analyst","role":"Media Analyst","summary":"A Media Analyst monitors, collects, analyses and interprets information from news, social media, digital platforms and other media sources to identify trends, narratives, audience behaviour, reputation signals and emerging issues.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Media Analyst monitors, collects, analyses and interprets information from news, social media, digital platforms and other media sources to identify trends, narratives, audience behaviour, reputation signals and emerging issues."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Digital Humanities / Cultural Studies provides a useful interdisciplinary foundation because it combines humanities research, culture, communication and digital methods. However, the degree alone is not sufficient for most modern media-analysis roles. The student should add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Media monitoring"},{"text":"Digital analytics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Social listening"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Excel/SQL"},{"text":"Python or R"},{"text":"Digital marketing fundamentals"},{"text":"AI-assisted research"},{"text":"Professional reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning is humanities + media intelligence + data analytics, rather than purely qualitative media studies."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Expected Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Digital & Media Foundation"},{"text":"BA + media research + analytics + monitoring + portfolio"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Media Intelligence"},{"text":"Media Analyst, Social Listening Analyst, Research Analyst"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Specialist Analysis"},{"text":"Senior Media Analyst, Media Intelligence 